{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-03-30 11:27:00', 'title': 'PG&E COWORKERS ROLL UP SLEEVES WITH CALIFORNIA STATE PARKS FOUNDATION FOR EARTH DAY CLIMATE ACTION EVENTS IN APRIL', 'text': 'PG&E VOLUNTEERS CELEBRATE 25 YEARS OF HELPING TO PRESERVE STATE PARKS OAKLAND, CALIF. , MARCH 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN WHAT HAS BECOME A TRADITION FOR A QUARTER-CENTURY, PG&E AND THE PG&E CORPORATION FOUNDATION ARE AGAIN PARTNERING WITH THE CALIFORNIA STATE PARKS FOUNDATION TO SUPPORT EARTH DAY CLIMATE ACTION\xa0EVENTS THROUGHOUT THE MONTH OF APRIL.'}